  "details": "Idk if this is happening to anyone else, but there’s a certain time where the newer avatars my friends load into will not load in at all. Instead, the game gives me the error robot for them. All the avatars I have saved load in perfectly fine, and some of the avatars my friends have that loaded for me before the update also load perfectly fine. \n\nI was aware that there was a “Avatar Pedestal” bug going around for some people, even my friends had the bug. But I didn’t have that glitch, all the avatar pedestals were loading fine for me at the time as that bug - and I heard that there was an update to fix that problem, but I don’t think I got that update cause I wasn’t experiencing the avatar pedestal glitch. And because of that, it’s now glitched for me. I’ve tried restarting Steam, even uninstalled and reinstalled VRChat, but I’m still getting the error robot from my friends. \n\nIt can’t be because of my storage, cause I use a gaming laptop and it has a lot of storage, I don’t think I’ve even used it all up.",
